      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "[quote=\"mwc146\"]\n\nDid we ever learn what started off the Shattered Timelines event? Was it just some kind of quantum fluke? Super Scientific Tachyon&#39;s experiment gone wrong? Team Leader Tachyon&#39;s experiment gone right? Iron Legacy punching the walls of reality until they buckled?\n\n[/quote]\n\nWe don&#39;t exactly know for sure. What we do know is that the growing unstablness of the Timelines is partly what cause Deadline to come to Earth in the first place because he knew what that ment the coming of OblivAeon (and why he tried to stop it).\n\nIt could be that OblivAeon started the shattering to begin the proccess of merging all realities into 1 single universe he could rule and dominate. Unfortunatly we know nothing about his motives so its hard to say.\n\nIt could be that Visionary&#39;s initial timejump was so violently extraordinary that it not only gave her than brain tumor thing, but that it also caused a tear in the time/space fabric that has been slowly getting worse as time went on. Knowing someone was powerful enough to do such a thing, OblivAeon is coming to set things in order.\n\nIt could be that Wager Master did it as a prank of sorts.\n\nLots of theories. No solid answers.\n",
