      "created_at": "2016-02-04T22:34:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My guess has been that Visionary's power is itself the source of all this instability.</p><p><span>Do you remember the Justice League Unlimited Episode in season 2, Epilogue? Amanda Waller is describing a battle between the JL and the Royal Flush Gang. Batman has to go kill the current Ace, whose reality-warping powers are out of control and threatening to destroy everything.</span></p><p>I'm thinking something like that.</p>",
