      "created_at": "2016-02-04T22:40:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Not saying you’re completely wrong, but we know Visionary survives, as she’s in Tactics. Here’s part of <a href=\"http://sentineltactics.com/multiverse/heroes/the-visionary\">the write-up</a>:</p>\n<p>[quote=Visionary's Bio]</p>\n<p>Years have passed, and The Visionary continues to work with the heroes of this time - not her time, but a time she helped make and helped preserve. She has found her access to the timelines cut off by recent events, and has little issue with that. But her body is failing as her mind becomes less and less connected to the physical world. She has taken to keeping an object of focus, psionically manipulating it constantly to keep her connected to reality. [/quote]</p>",
