      "created_at": "2016-02-11T23:09:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The kickstarter implies that Oblivaeon is the cause:</p><blockquote><p>OblivAeon itself has manifested on Earth in this timeline to put an end to the pitiful resistance. If it succeeds, everything will be destroyed. However, if the heroes are able to stop OblivAeon, the cracks which run through all realities will be repaired as the cosmic power that created them is destroyed, effectively cutting the timelines and realities off from each other.&nbsp;</p></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p>",
